== Effects ==
* Adds a chance to fire tears that [[slow]] enemies.

== Notes ==
* The chance to fire a slowing tear depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac1 { 10 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} * 0.5  \right \rfloor}</math><ref>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/15K8Xgxoxdx68AIaxuLXgZoJJlG36UPgy3_aeDpAM5tU/edit?usp=sharing</ref>
** At base luck (0), the chance is 10%, maxing out at 100% at 18 luck.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 20% and having both to 30%.

== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Chewed Pen|Chewed Pen]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Community Remix'', it was named ''The Pen''.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* This trinket is extremely similar to the [[enboi:Game Squid|Game Squid]] trinket found in the eternal edition of the original The Binding of Isaac, which was never added to Rebirth.

